- **Luis (A2):** $180 upfront, 20% sales share, 40 mini pies, 9:00 a.m. setup
- **Hana (A3):** $220 upfront, 15% sales share, 30 pastries, 8:30 a.m. setup
- **Dev (A4):** $260 upfront, 10% sales share, 50 dumplings, 10:00 a.m. setup
